[OC][A Hunter] |cffffcc00Gear (Gar'im):|r Disjointed Shoes - leather, +12 Attack Power and +5 spell damage: take them. Alacritous Treads are mail (+5 Str +5 Agi), which you wear at 40, not now; Incinerator's Boots are cloth: pass
